.TH ANIM_STEP 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
anim_step \- Advance the animation by dt seconds using the timing in a (the Anim that st\->anim refers to)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.BI "void anim_step(AnimState *st, const Anim *a, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance the animation by dt seconds using the timing in a (the Anim that st\->anim refers to). Call once per update tick. Several frames can advance in one call after a long dt. Looping animations wrap; others stop on the last frame and set st\->done, after which the call does nothing until anim_set() restarts them. A count of 1 never advances.
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anim_set (3),
.BR anim_frame (3),
.BR Anim (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
